# RazorCal source licenses and attribution

RazorCal contains records attributed to multiple upstream corpora. Applicable
upstream terms remain in effect; this file does not grant a new dataset-wide
license or establish redistribution rights for every record.

## Recorded license information

The following information is retained from the dataset documentation. Exact
source releases, record mappings and applicable terms require review against
the upstream materials before redistribution.

| Recorded source | Attribution | Recorded terms / status |
|---|---|---|
| Nemotron-Post-Training-Dataset-v1 / v2 / v3 and Nemotron source slices | NVIDIA | CC-BY-4.0 was recorded; verify the specific source release and slice |
| Nemotron-SFT-OpenCode-V1 | NVIDIA | CC-BY-4.0 was recorded; verify the specific source release |
| smoltalk2 | HuggingFaceTB | ODC-BY-1.0 plus the terms of its upstream slices |
| OpenHermes-2.5 | Teknium | Consult the collection and its individual source terms; no uniform license is asserted here |
| tulu-3-sft-personas-instruction-following | Allen AI | ODC-BY-1.0; mapping to included records is not established here |
| Dolci-Precise-IF / Dolci-Python-Algorithms | Dolci source labels | Recorded terms: CC-BY-4.0; the exact source releases and terms remain to be verified |
| Nemotron-Cascade-2-SFT-Data / math | NVIDIA | CC-BY-4.0 was recorded; the slice was taken whole, so per-record mapping within it is not established |

The source-label inventory is in [README.md](README.md). A `sub_source`
label is attribution metadata, not sufficient evidence of a source license.
See [FIDELITY_AUDIT.md](FIDELITY_AUDIT.md) for provenance status.

## Use and redistribution

Retain source labels and applicable attribution notices. Before using or
redistributing records, review their upstream terms and resolve any missing
source mapping or permission information. This document does not certify
compatibility among the listed terms.

Project script licenses are separate from dataset terms; see [LICENSE-CODE](LICENSE-CODE)
and the project [LICENSE](../LICENSE). Citation metadata is in
[CITATION.cff](../CITATION.cff); third-party attribution is in [NOTICE](../NOTICE).

